<p class="text" style="margin:16px 0 0;color:#1b1a2e;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;text-align:left">Hi <span dir="auto" style="unicode-bidi:isolate">Layla</span>,</p>
<p class="text" style="margin:16px 0 0;color:#1b1a2e;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;text-align:left">Thanks for signing up for AIVORE. Confirm that <strong><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate">layla@example.com</span></strong> is your address to activate your account.</p>
